172	# Register the kept OAuth custom routes via FastMCP. The
173	# /.well-known/oauth-protected-resource route is mounted natively by
174	# RemoteAuthProvider at the suffix-scoped path
175	# (/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource/mcp). The authorization-server
